# Spikeshell Harrier: "return target creature or Vehicle an opponent controls to its owner's hand. If that opponent's speed is
# greater than each other player's speed, reduce that opponent's speed by 1." "That opponent" is the one who controls the target,
# not its owner. Bot2 steals Bot1's Memnite with Control Magic (CR 613.1b) and has speed 2 from Burnout Bashtronaut and a Bolt
# (CR 704.5aa, 702.179d). On turn 5 the Harrier returns the Memnite to Bot1's hand and slows Bot2, its controller, from 2 to 1;
# measured by its owner, Bot1 (no speed, 0 by CR 702.179f), nobody would be slowed.

